    value: '{0:CommaNumber}'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12
    value: '<size=18>3 or more Scatters triggers Candy Stick Bonus Feature.

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: '<size=18>Wild substitutes for all symbols except Scatter.

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_12
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>Up To 216 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: "<style=title><size=45>Sugar Rush Feature\r</size></style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=24>- When triggered, reels will stretch horizontally to 7 or 9 positions
      wide.\n- Reels may also stretch vertically to 5 or 6 positions high.\n- When
      stretched, there will be a set of paylines each in reel 1 \n   to reel 5, reel
      3 to reel 7, and reel 5 to reel 9, creating total 216 lines maximum.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: "<style=title><size=45>Wild Reels Feature\r\n</size></style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=24>- When Sugar Rush Feature is over, the Wild Reels Feature will
      be triggered.\r\n- Full Wild Reels will slide from left to right to award locked
      Wild symbols     \n  where they land.\n- Once feature is over, multiplier of
      up to 10x may be awarded to total win \n  amount from the line pays.\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: "<style=title><size=45>Choose Your Bonus\r</size></style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=24>- 3 or more Scatters triggers the Choose Your Bonus popup and
      3 lollipops.\n- Choose your bonus to receive one of the following :\n     -
      Free Games Bonus\r \n     - Mystery Link Bonus\r\n     - Collect Candy Bonus\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5
    value: "<style=title><size=45>Free Games Bonus\r\n</size></style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5
    value: "<size=24>- In Free Games, Sugar Rush Feature is more frequent than in
      Base Game.\n- Scatters do not appear in Free Games. \n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_6
    value: "<style=title><size=45>Mystery Link Bonus\r\n</size></style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_6
    value: "<size=20>- When triggered, only Choco Doughnut symbols will appear in
      individual symbol spots.\n- All Choco Doughnut symbols get locked in place while
      remaining spots spin 3 times for free.\n- Receiving one or more Choco Doughnuts
      in the empty spots re-sets number of free spins to 3. \r\n- When bonus ends,
      award the sum total of credit values on Choco Doughnut symbols.\n- 16 Choco
      Doughnut Symbols awards Grand Jackpot!\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_7
    value: "<style=title><size=45>Collect Candy Bonus\r\n</size></style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_7
    value: "<size=20>- Collect candies and win amounts until \"End Bonus\" appears.\n-
      User may collect multiplier. Multiplier will be applied to the remaining candies.\n-
      Picking \"End Bonus\"ends the bonus, but there may be a \"Safe\" chance with
      random \n  probability.\n- When saved, return to the bonus to continue collecting
      candies.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES_1
    value: '<style=title><size=45>Slot 1

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES_2
    value: '<style=title><size=45>Slot 2

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES_3
    value: '<style=title><size=45>Slot 3

      </size></style>'
  - key: SWC_FREE_SPIN_RESULT_CREDIT
    value: '{0:CommaNumber}'
  - key: SWC_FREE_SPIN_TIER_MULTIPLIER
    value: X {0}
  - key: SWC_FREE_SPIN_RESULT_CREDIT
    value: '{0:CommaNumber}'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Sweet Cash
